Friday
======

This project includes design adaptations from the following open-source
projects:

OpenJarvis (https://github.com/open-jarvis/OpenJarvis)
  Copyright Stanford Hazy Research / SAIL
  License: Apache License 2.0
  Used for: the forgiving small-model output parser
  (lib/services/ai/friday_parser.dart, key/value normalization and
  no-salvage handling adapted from src/openjarvis/agents/native_react.py)
  and the plain-Markdown SOUL.md / MEMORY.md / USER.md memory design
  (lib/services/storage/memory_store.dart).

Closepaw (https://github.com/imoonkey/closepaw)
  License: Apache License 2.0
  Used for: design ideas only (on-device agent structure); no code copied.

